WEBVTT

00:00.560 --> 00:01.960
Enough

00:02.280 --> 00:04.613
When did I say to withdraw south?

00:05.560 --> 00:06.960
Xuan Kingdom and Wuzhao

00:07.240 --> 00:08.907
Have no business to do

00:09.800 --> 00:11.520
Then what does brother-in-law mean?

00:12.040 --> 00:13.760
Your guards will work harder tonight

00:13.840 --> 00:15.480
Secretly keep a close watch on that Chu Maolun

00:15.560 --> 00:17.227
And those two Wuzhao men

00:17.960 --> 00:18.960
Let them do whatever they want

00:19.040 --> 00:19.760
Don't stop them

00:19.840 --> 00:20.560
But

00:20.640 --> 00:22.640
Report to me at any time

00:26.000 --> 00:26.880
Yes

